  e-Fatura sample that reaches spec field `refundInvoiceReference` — the row that
  tells the reader WHICH invoice is being reversed. Schematron makes the
  reference mandatory for this type, so its absence would be a real defect, not
  a cosmetic one.

  Secondary branch: the buyer is a NATURAL PERSON (TCKN + cac:Person). PartyName
  chooses the person's name over the trade title when TCKN and cac:Person appear
  together, and no other e-Fatura sample exercises that choice.
-->
